{
  "dom_id": "step-38155",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Recovering the Joint PDF from a Joint CDF",
  "problem": "The joint CDF of two continuous random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14284682/assets/747403765cdc8cdcdad6913f9253d75dc947aab12520d009e25fcd9bd24ad3ae.svg)\n\nFind the joint PDF $f(x,y)$ for $0 \\leq x \\leq 1, \\; y \\geq 0.$",
  "worked_solution": "Since the partial derivatives of $F(x,y)$ are defined, the joint probability density function $f(x, y)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x,y) = \\dfrac{\\partial^2}{\\partial x \\partial y} F(x,y).\n$$\n\nFor $0 \\leq x \\leq 1$ and $y \\geq 0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =\\frac{{∂}^{2}}{∂x∂y}F(x,y) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{∂}{∂y}({x}^{2}(1-{e}^{-y}))) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}\\frac{∂}{∂y}(1-{e}^{-y})) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}{e}^{-y}) \\\\  & ={e}^{-y}\\cdot \\frac{∂}{∂x}({x}^{2}) \\\\  & ={e}^{-y}\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =2x{e}^{-y}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nOtherwise, $f(x,y) = 0.$\n\nTherefore, we have\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14284682/assets/cedf8a240fb8e0642642d5f39a4b174219e9b7c0283a5a3a469f431815e9909b.svg)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-38155\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"38155\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"10117\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-38155\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-9\">Recovering the Joint PDF from a Joint CDF</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"38155\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                         